{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_bryota_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_bryota_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"风情街的日与夜","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_bryota_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"fa1ac58fef6c162799769ce98a40ef014ea9bf1cebb14e1e18d847233c324e18","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"与火山“告别”的日子已经过去两个星期了，亲爱的汐斯塔居民们，你们还在想念着火山喷发时的奇景吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道在那个瞬间，你们心里都想着什么？毕竟是此生唯一的时刻——噢，但愿它是此生唯一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“太好了，我还活着！”“就这样？结束了？”......还是“再见，我们以前的汐斯塔！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"广播声","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，在那时我满脑子都想着伸手从天上揪一块火山云下来，尝尝那到底是番茄味还是草莓味的“棉花糖”！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快要好了哦，想加点什么？草莓酱还是番茄酱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要加棉花糖！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有这种吃法。喏，路特船长，拿好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我不是船长，是上校。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的路特上校，希望草莓酱合你的口味。丽芙要什么酱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽芙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（你也要吗？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（可是埃尼斯只煎了这么多，如果你也要，可就没有哈莉的份了！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要不，我的分你一半，好不好？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（丽芙她......在和空气对话？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（该不会是在说梦话吧？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（瞌睡虫。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（还是切成两半好了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽芙，这是你的。一半草莓酱，一半番茄酱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！这不公平！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好，路特上校也有番茄酱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，现在是益智竞猜时间——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果埃尼斯和哈莉都不在家，你们自己弄完饭，第一件要做的事是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"关火——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这太简单了，前天你刚出过这道题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽芙的答案是什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，丽芙——不要刚吃一口就往外跑，丽芙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么突然就跑了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（丽芙她今天一直怪怪的......该不会是因为我要走了，不开心，所以才心不在焉的？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（果然还是要找她好好谈一谈。临走前带她去宠物店逛逛吧，看看有没有愿意陪陪她的小动物。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇！我的煎蛋......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！刚刚才说过，弄完饭要关火！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......别学我啊，这是个错误的示范。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一个饭没吃完就出去乱跑，另一个又弄糊了自己的早餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而乖乖坐在餐桌边，很听话地吃早饭的路特上校，却得不到像样的奖励。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要什么奖励？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一个“D32钢战士”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，我倒是想到一个不错的奖励。比如，让我忘记你用我的润唇膏在酒水单上乱涂乱画？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不是我做的，哈莉！或者我把要求降低一点，请埃尼斯再给我一个煎蛋，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讨价还价的孩子，要扣掉一个奖励。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，那我也要走了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特，今天又要去哪里玩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不——告——诉——你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，加了胡椒粉，和以前一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是把锅里那个煎过了火的“可怜蛋”给我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，还不算太糊......我吃就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（伸手拿杯子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，路特！那个是......别喝！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈莉！不是说过了，不要把喝剩下的酒随便放在吧台上，路特他们可还没......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，年轻人，一点点橘子酒罢了，不要那么紧张。最近几天，你可比我更像他们的老妈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“大日子”来临前，不能松弛应对的人，可成不了环游各地的探险家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是两码事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即将开始演奏的乐手可没时间担心旁人有没有上好弦。与其操心我们，不如想想你自己的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过几天就要走了，打工的地方都交接完毕了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三，二，一，唔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎哎，你慢着点儿......我抵住这边了，用力，抬——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用力——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......好了，这应该就是最后一箱了。终端上显示还有一批没送到汐斯塔的货品，等它们抵达后，就拜托你帮忙送到库房，仔细盘点咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"是峯联贸易的订单，你就放心吧。有钱拿，我自然不会怠慢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，不过最近的加急货件一批接着一批，又少了你来分担工作，看来今天我又得送到晚上咯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，埃尼斯，你真的下定决心，要离开汐斯塔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，已经决定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"真没想到......这下振兴汐斯塔旅游业的道路上，又少了一员干将啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"来，拥抱一下吧，祝你一路顺风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干嘛这么郑重，搞得像我再也不回来了一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，一个几乎天天碰面的好友忽然就要走了，肯定会舍不得的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"想来你的家人更不好受，毕竟你们朝夕相处。风情街改建的事刚尘埃落定，却又要面临分别，实在是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈莉她倒是接受得挺快的，她年轻时就到处跑，估计早就想让我也出去闯闯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于弟弟妹妹，可能确实还需要一点时间吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天我也一直在想，我能给他们留下点什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，埃尼斯，那个走在路上自言自语的，是不是你妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是她......有点奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先跟过去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"塔吊伸展着长臂，吊绳缓缓划过天空中绵绵的云。像是一个熟练的甜点师，在聚精会神地抹平蛋糕上的奶霜。\n远处的汐斯塔火山间断着冒出灰白的烟。自从两周前大发脾气后，它就一直这样气喘吁吁的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一半抹了草莓酱的煎蛋，是你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汤姆爷爷今天没有开店，所以就没办法给你买冰淇淋啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，这个草莓酱也很好吃哦，是埃尼斯自己做的。埃尼斯他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽芙她......怎么又来未建成地块了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"火山爆发时，她也是独自一个人跑来这里......难道说是那天的海啸，让她留下心理阴影了？不，那她应该更不敢来才对。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这里更近，差不多能听得清楚一点。但愿别被她发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？她身边好像有一个......毛绒绒的生物？原来丽芙之前一直是在和它说话吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（进食）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是埃尼斯送给我的小土偶。卷卷的头发，耳边还有朵小花，你觉得它像我吗？埃尼斯说，这是他用魔法变的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯是个骗子，他根本不会魔法。故事里的魔术师可都是神通广大，从来不会生病的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不满地哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你想告诉我，其实魔术师也是会生病的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我宁愿埃尼斯不是魔术师。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望他没得“石头病”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低落地哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生姐姐说，埃尼斯的病，还不算太严重。可是那一回，他却一连在医院里睡了整整三天......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前，风情街的大人们也说过，如果得了“石头病”，最后就会变成石头。不能动，也不能说话，风一吹就会散成细细的沙子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不想埃尼斯变成那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（靠近蹭蹭）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近几天，埃尼斯一直怪怪的，看起来很紧张，会不会也是“石头病”导致的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，马上埃尼斯就要走了，他要上一艘名叫罗德岛的船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（疑惑地哼叫）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不舍得，我当然不舍得埃尼斯呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，哈莉说那艘船上有好多好多厉害的医生，他们一定会把埃尼斯的“石头病”治好的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要埃尼斯能恢复健康，那就好啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于风情街这里......还有哈莉和你陪着我不是吗？哦，对了，还有讨厌的路特。我们可以一起等着埃尼斯回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我还以为她是不舍得我离开，原来丽芙是因为担心我的病情，才一直闷闷不乐的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不应该啊埃尼斯，让妹妹这样担心你——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"开朗的生物","speakerId":"avg_npc_1010_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（转头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个毛绒绒的......注意到我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，好像在海啸袭来那时，我也见到了一模一样的生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来那都不是梦啊......就是它们保护了我和丽芙，保护了汐斯塔吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"丽芙也交到了“新朋友”啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......汤姆爷爷发来的短讯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g1_siestacommercialstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汤姆爷爷！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汤姆爷爷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘘！小声点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我在这儿，遮阳棚上，抬头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您这又是在做什么？短讯里那么急着让我过来，一连打了好几个感叹号......您这店今天又没开门，我还以为您出了啥大事——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乱想什么呢，臭小子！我的身子骨还没那么糟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了，快点上来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？上去干什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你这倔小子，上来你就知道了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，遮阳棚上有什么好东西吗？可别告诉我，您只是想邀请我共赏汐斯塔午后的太阳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看那——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？那个小孩子是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特？他站在乐器店门口干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打工。最近一段时间总能见到他，看上去像是在帮忙招揽顾客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打工？他打什么工......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样想来，路特这几天确实总是不见人影。每次问他去做什么，总是支支吾吾地不愿说，弄得怪神秘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道是因为零花钱不够了？该不会就是为了买那个“D32钢战士”吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂喂，你这个当哥哥的，老把他们当成小不点看护着怎么行，要多关注他们的成长啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们的......成长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯哼。路特那小子，看样子是开始对乐器感兴趣了。不愧是在风情街长大的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乐器店老板和我提起过，路特向他打听吉他的价格，想学吉他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来哈莉那几个不轻易示人的吉他技巧，总算是有人继承咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他现在也太小了......就算他真想买，也可以找我要钱啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找乐器店老板问问去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎哎，笨小子，你可别扫兴了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当哥哥的总是那么自大，总是想为弟弟妹妹包办一切，觉得他们永远离不开自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看啊，是你离不开他们吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......我们一直是这样相处的啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正是因为我要离开了，我才要把我能为他们做的，都做到最好。只是一把吉他而已，我可以给他买。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你能买，难道你还能教？就算你能教，难道你还能替他练习？干脆你去帮他实现音乐梦想得了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仔细想想，丽芙有陪伴她的“新朋友”，路特也开始有想做的事了......好像他们确实不再像以前一样需要我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忽然感觉，好残酷啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你再舍不得这两个小跟屁虫，时间是公平的，他们总会长大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迟早有一天，他们会为自己的人生做决定，就像你如今决定离开汐斯塔一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我也不想缺席他们的成长啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看路特那一板一眼地给游客介绍商品的样子，是不是很像一个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像在旧汐斯塔海滩上，到处向游客推销瓶装汽水的小埃尼斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然未来的日子里，你无法陪在弟弟妹妹身边。但是在你们相处的时间里，你早就在潜移默化之中，影响了他们的行为与想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们在“纯白火山”的回忆，会替你陪着他们长大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的......回忆......“纯白火山”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像有点明白......为什么哈莉之前那么反对拆掉“纯白火山”了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，小时候的你还是要比路特精明得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟你可是会把沙滩烤肉铺的调料偷偷换成变态辣，然后守在旁边若无其事地卖冰汽水的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前的事您居然还记得啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是谁尝一口那无比“火辣”的烤肉，都会永生难忘的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是想着快点帮店里把饮料都卖完嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样就可以早点收工，哈莉就能腾出时间来，和乐队老友们练上几首新写的曲子，而我也能陪路特和丽芙去海里游上几圈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，那个时候路特和丽芙才刚来到家里没多久，一双小手连浮球都抱不住，只能把浮板绑在后背上，抓着我的胳膊，在浅水里扑腾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一转眼他们就......时间过得可真快呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些都是，我们一家人的回忆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您，汤姆爷爷！我要去水上乐园的工地一趟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道临走前我要留下些什么了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年轻人，精力真是旺盛啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你刚来到汐斯塔的时候，也和埃尼斯一样，像是有永远用不完的精力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才，我讲得怎么样？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"冷饮店的门把手轻轻旋动，一直紧闭的店门缓缓打开。\n女人从店里走了出来，望着遮阳棚上，正悠闲地晒太阳的老店主。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有水平。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是比风情街还要年长的汤姆叔叔。还有什么家庭问题是您无法解决的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拜你给的提纲所赐，我难得过了一把嘴瘾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过既然你想得这么清楚，何不自己去跟埃尼斯讲，非要借我这个外人之口来“打边鼓”呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，为什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈，和查克分别时倒是很痛快，照样喝照样唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"轮到儿子要离开时，果真是不一样咯，到底是做母亲的......或许应该让到处疯玩的查克跟你换换。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还不愿意和他换哩！从成为他们母亲的那一刻起，我就做不来旅行家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我欠您一杯好酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让我尝尝你新创的“棉花落日”吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加一点变态辣辣椒粉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷饮店店主","speakerId":"avg_npc_1002_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正合我意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g9_purewhitevolcano_inside"},{"type":"narration","text":"叮，叮。\n咣，咣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前的门牌，应该是这样的。唔，尺寸好像不太对，这里还得弄短一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，这个木材太软了，还是得用石料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看看......工地那边带来的石头，好像还有一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一块还不错。好，在他们回来之前，赶紧弄完！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已经迫不及待想看到他们吃惊的样子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......怎么又流鼻血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能是因为我现在充满干劲，热血沸腾吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？哈、哈莉？！你怎么这么早......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些石头，土块......你小子，又在偷偷练习源石技艺？医生的话都当耳旁风了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是啊！你听我解释......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（擦鼻血）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你看。刻刀，锤子，弓锯......这些都是我亲手做的！不是用源石技艺做的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在还看不太出来吧？只要把这个“屋顶”放上来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锵锵！欢迎回到，最初的“纯白火山”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样，这个模型逼真吧？每个部件都是我一点点做的！你看这个指路牌，是不是和旧风情街的一模一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜我的雕工不太行......这个小冰箱的把手就做得有点歪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这就是你临走前要留给我们的“惊喜”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这可不是我的个人作品哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在它还不算是完全体，还差几个最最重要的小部件。剩下的部分，需要咱们一家人，一起完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"土偶？这是我？怎么是爆炸头？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本来是有辫子的，被我不小心刻断了，只好改成爆炸头了......在我小时候，你就是这样蓬松的发型，不是吗？我还一直觉得挺酷的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒也不赖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，最早的“纯白火山”可不是这样的。这些沙滩椅、充气船，都是扩建之后才有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"准确地说，这些都是有了丽芙和路特以后才有的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从那时起，才是完整的“纯白火山”，是“我们的回忆”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特&丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"超小的“纯白火山”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是哥哥做的“纯白火山”模型，怎么样，是不是很厉害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"站在超小“纯白火山”门前的是......哈莉和埃尼斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是小土偶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯，没错！探险队的队员们，你们的小土偶呢？也一起放进来吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有两个新朋友——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......土偶小毛羊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......土偶“D32钢战士”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不，这不是“D32钢战士”，是“固源岩少校”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它看见了小小年纪就在乐器店打工的路特上校，深受鼓舞，所以就来追随我们啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（埃尼斯怎么知道的？是不是你偷偷说啦！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我......我可没有！一定是你太笨，所以才露馅啦！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，总、总而言之！“固源岩少校”和我一样，都很期待路特上校买到他心仪的吉他，开启他的音乐之路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特，在我下次回来之前，你可要从哈莉那里多学来几首曲子啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我可没同意教他啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么吉他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？你去乐器店帮忙，不是为了买吉他吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特，埃尼斯好像比你还笨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是告诉他吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小男孩耸了耸肩，从小背包里拿出了一个小木盒子，交到埃尼斯的手中。\n光滑的铁片整齐地排列，末端组成一条漂亮的弧线，看上去如同大海献给沙滩的一簇浪花。\n木盒子的表面上用彩笔画着“纯白火山”的标志，粉粉的小毛羊贴在标志旁，好像要把它一口吃掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......拇指琴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送给我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，这是我和乐器店老板“交易”来的。上面的图案是丽芙画的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抱住）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路特","speakerId":"avg_npc_991_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"丽芙","speakerId":"avg_npc_992_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！埃尼斯！太紧了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路特......丽芙......谢谢你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"非常好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来路特和丽芙都很了解你，知道你是个勉强只会弹拇指琴的“乐器笨蛋”啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈莉，这个时候就请不要破坏气氛啦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g2_siestacommercialstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，大功告成！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来把这个“纯白火山”模型放在店门口还挺合适的，像个吉祥物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等水上乐园建好后，会不会有游客来问，这个小房子是什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"与其期待有客人欣赏你的杰作，不如祈祷不要有醉鬼吐在上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈莉，我相信你会阻止这种事情发生的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟在之后的很长一段时间里，我只能以生活在“纯白火山”模型里的小土偶的形式，陪在你们身边啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，照顾好自己比什么都强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，你不觉得这个模型里少了些什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......天啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘了把“查克”也放进去了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"埃尼斯！有你的加急包裹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_021","isRemote":false,"text":"谢天谢地，最后一件是寄给你的。不然我可真要诅咒我这繁忙又枯燥的一天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加急包裹？是谁寄来的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"发件人是......查、查克？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"少年略带期待地打开了这个从远方寄来的纸盒子。\n层层的旧报纸包裹着的，是一个由干藤编成的小草人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个草人，好像长得有点像查克啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，它的背包......是纸叠成的？里面好像有字。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“儿子，听说你要离开‘纯白火山’了？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“替我告诉哈莉，我在咱们的家庭银行账户里留下了一点‘金喜’。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很有他的风格。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"哈莉","speakerId":"avg_npc_994_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望他带来的是路特和丽芙下个学期的住宿费，而不是一份债务通知单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“草人是我在玻利瓦尔时，当地人教我编的。是不是和我一样强壮？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"忽有一阵风吹来，草人的手脚像藤条一样晃荡起来。\n树叶做成的帽子也被吹飞了，露出草人秃秃的头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“就让它代替我，为你送行吧！”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“外出旅行可不是简单的事。你已经规划好航线了吗？旅程的终点又在哪里？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“在我们相聚之前，我期待着你的答案。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"几个熟客掀起了门帘，母亲招呼着他们坐下，冰块在摇酒壶中舞蹈。\n弟弟妹妹的欢笑声也传入耳中，恍惚中，他像是回到了那片沙滩，回到了那间儿时的小店。\n少年望向风情街的尽头，不觉间，落日的余晖已为寻常的夜，誊写好了乐谱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于，要出发了啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃尼斯","speakerId":"avg_4106_bryota_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未来，会是什么样的呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
